### 0. Login (Run this once to set {{auth_token}})
POST http://localhost:8082/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "tester@mysite.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("auth_token", response.body.accessToken);
    client.log("Token received: " + response.body.accessToken);
%}

### 1. VALIDATION TEST (Expect 422 VALIDATION_ERROR)
POST http://localhost:8082/api/users
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

{}

### 2. CONFLICT TEST (Expect 409 EMAIL_ALREADY_EXISTS)
POST http://localhost:8082/api/users
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

{
  "email": "tester@mysite.com",
  "password": "password123",
  "firstName": "Duplicate",
  "lastName": "User",
  "role": "TENANT",
  "authProvider": "LOCAL"
}

### 3. NOT FOUND TEST (Expect 404 NOT_FOUND)
GET http://localhost:8082/api/users/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### 4. BUSINESS RULE TEST (Expect 422 BUSINESS_RULE_VIOLATION)
POST http://localhost:8082/api/listings/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/unpublish
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

### 5. REQUEST-ID TEST (Check "meta" section in response)
GET http://localhost:8082/api/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
X-Request-Id: custom-trace-id-123

### 6. INTERNAL ERROR TEST (Expect 500 INTERNAL_ERROR)
GET http://localhost:8082/api/users/me
Authorization: Bearer broken-token-123